<title>USA: Kellogg sets tie-in with &quot;Batman &amp; Robin&quot;.</title>
<headline>Kellogg sets tie-in with &quot;Batman &amp; Robin&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BATTLE CREEK, Mich. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Breakfast cereal giant Kellogg Co said Thursday it will team up with &quot;Batman &amp; Robin,&quot; the Warner Bros motion picture that is expected to be released nationwide on June 20.</p>
<p>Kellogg said 13 of its ready-to-eat cereals, plus Kellogg's Pop-Tarts and Kellogg's Eggo Waffles, feature a variety of movie tie-ins including new movie-themed food products, special movie character package designs and promotional offers.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))  </p>
<p>.</p>
